description:
Twenty years ago, Les Composantes began with a selection of vintage pieces, born from a desire for creative independence and an eye for detail. That instinct and an appreciation for design that endures have shaped everything that followed.


From there, Sézane was born in Paris in 2013\. Since then, la famille has continued to grow, with Octobre Éditions for men, Les Composantes reimagined as a home and lifestyle destination, and Petit Sézane for children.


Our story has unfolded like life itself: through instinct, spontaneity, and learning. We developed a singular approach to detail, service, and connection. A way of imagining a Parisian wardrobe for real life, first online and later through our Appartements. From day one, we have been guided by a commitment to making beautiful design accessible, without ever compromising on quality.


To continue to co\-construct the next chapter and beyond, we are looking for creative, organized and agile talents, who share our passion to perpetually improve all that can be.


Care to imagine what comes next with us? We can't wait to hear from you!


We are looking for a **Stockist (M/F)** to join our retail team for our Madrid store on a temporary contract on a full\-time (40h) basis (from octobre to january).


Reporting to the Store Director and the Assistant Stock Manager, your main responsibilities will be:

**Ensure efficient stock management:**


In the Apartment:

* Ensure proper receipt of deliveries (unpacking, sorting, labeling, scanning, storage);
* Record deliveries following processes;
* Perform daily store replenishment in accordance with merchandising standards;
* Ensure proper stockroom maintenance by guaranteeing rigorous and optimal organization;
* Monitor the smooth running of transfer procedures between stores;
* Participate in store inventories (rolling, monthly, fiscal);
* Meet the needs of the sales team by bringing items requested by customers to the floor.

**Deliver a unique customer experience:**

* Have perfect knowledge of stock to meet Customer expectations as efficiently as possible;
* Streamline the connection between the stockroom and sales floor through structured organization;
* Ensure products are presented according to Octane standards;
* Be an ambassador for the Brand's omnichannel approach (apartment and web);
* Show curiosity and develop an in\-depth knowledge of the Brand and products;
* Know our CSR policy to respond to customers.

**Ensure brand image:**

* Participate in proper product presentation by highlighting new items;
* Help the Visual Merchandiser or Visual Merchandising Liaison with preparation of new layouts;
* Check the arrangement and labeling of products in the stockroom;
* Ensure product quality through meticulous organization;
* Suggest merchandising adjustments to optimize stock rotation;
* Ensure daily supply to the Apartment and perfect organization of stockrooms.

**Have team spirit:**

* Be a team player, participate in all related tasks;
* Contribute to creating a positive and harmonious environment to create group synergy;
* Relay the brand's commitments;
* Have team spirit and helpfulness to foster group synergy and cohesion.



**Requirements**  

* + You are autonomous and responsive, to optimize the arrangement of replenishment and new items;  

	Careful and diligent, you handle products with the utmost care;
* + You understand Retail challenges and don't hesitate to adapt quickly and efficiently;
	+ Prioritization and time management don't scare you;  

	A good communicator, you respond to salespeople's requests to satisfy customer needs;
	+ You enjoy teamwork?


Sezane recruits and values all talents, regardless of your gender, age, nationality, culture, religious beliefs, and sexual orientation.


Do you recognize yourself in this description and wish to join the Sezane adventure?


Then wait no longer!
